@startuml 25-seq-website-form
!include ../../_style.iuml
title Website submission wizard (current state)

actor Owner
participant "WebsiteForm\nstepIndex state" as form
participant "InitialStep (0)\nbanner editor" as s0
participant "CodeStep (1)" as s1
participant "PreregisterStep (2)" as s2
participant "ReviewStep (3)" as s3
participant "GithubStep (4)" as s4
participant "KeywordsStep (5)" as s5
participant "QueryClient" as qc
participant "nos-sr" as api

Owner -> s0 : customise badge
s0 -> form : setBannerCode(html), updateStep(1)
Owner -> s1 : copy code, paste on own site
s1 -> form : updateStep(2)

Owner -> s2 : enter url
s2 -> api : POST /website {url: "https://" + url}
api --> s2 : IPreregisterWebsite (scraped)
s2 -> form : setPreregister(data), updateStep(3)

Owner -> s3 : edit name / description / color\n(EditableText, EditableColor)
s3 -> form : setPreregister, updateStep(4)
Owner -> s4 : repo url
s4 -> form : setPreregister, updateStep(5)

Owner -> s5 : pick categories (chips from categories.ts)
s5 -> qc : useRegisterWebsite.mutate({...preregister, keywords: names})
qc -> qc : onMutate: append parseRegisterDataToWebsite()\nto ['websites'] and ['keywords']
qc -> api : PATCH /website
api --> qc : 200 {message}
note right #FDECEA
  Stub: nothing is saved.
end note
qc -> qc : onSettled: invalidate websites + keywords\n→ refetch, and the new site disappears
s5 -> form : onSuccess → toast "foi adicionado!", reset to step 0

note over form, s5
  Steps move by hardcoded indices (updateStep(5)); StepTitle goes back with index-1.
  All state lives in the parent through props (StepComponentProps). No form library.
  Badge snippet: the brand link uses NOS_NO_CABO_URL (nosnocabo.pages.dev), but the
  logo and the "random" link point to www.nosnocabo.com, and previous/next are href="#".
  There is no webring navigation endpoint (random/next/prev) on the backend.
end note

@enduml
